  "goodToKnow": "Steril means sterile: germ-free in medicine (sterile Handschuhe; the native word is keimfrei), infertile in biology, and figuratively lifeless or soulless: eine sterile Atmosphäre, sterile Architektur. Sterilisieren means to sterilise. In German pronunciation, st- is said sht- in this word: shte-REEL. Opposite figuratively: lebendig, gemütlich."
